# Pyroclasm: "deals 2 damage to each creature." Bot1 has an Ornithopter (0/2) and a Fanatic of Rhonas (1/4); Bot2 casts
# Pyroclasm with its own Ornithopter in play. Both Ornithopters die (2 is lethal to toughness 2, whoever controls them), the
# Fanatic survives with 2 damage marked (2 is not lethal to 4), and neither player nor any Mox (artifacts that are not
# creatures) is touched.

